  {
   "mode": "section",
   "target": "overview.md",
   "section": "What this is",
   "body": "Salty Surf is an Oxygen Not Included mod that lets the Mechanical Surfboard run on Salt Water as well as Water. Either liquid fills the tank without damaging the building, the board is ready once the tank holds the usual 2 kg of either, and while a Duplicant surfs the board spills whatever it was fed. Every other liquid is treated as in the base game: it damages the building and is dumped. The building's info panel lists both accepted liquids. Version 0.2.0 is on the Steam Workshop (id 3816726470); `mod_info.yaml` sets `supportedContent: ALL` and `minimumSupportedBuild: 744825`. Available in English, Chinese (Simplified), Korean and Russian."
  }
